# PLAN-985 T-A02 — the M2-cover tracked corpus: parent-side observation
# for the two frozen recipe families (plain source run + owned-resource
# run), judged PARENT-SIDE (the workers never see the expected outcomes).
# Rows map into the ab-obligations matrix (`autolang.ab-obligations/1`):
# plain-run -> L-26/L-05 (scalar arithmetic/control) via the av core
# lane; owned-relay -> L-06/L-08/S-02 (view/mut/move + owned records and
# strings) via the av owned-resource lane. Registered by 985/T-A02; the
# green gate plus the wrong-oracle red control live in the conformance
# host suite (`ace_m2_p985_cover_*`).

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "ace.m2.p985.cover.plain-run"
  tags: ["ace-m2", "m2-cover-985", "plan-985"]
  links: ["PLAN-985"]
  source: { file: "src/plain-run.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "av-plain", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: { recipe: "ac-av/core-run-v1", av: { entry: "d_main" }, steps: [{ op: "run" }] },
      expect: { completion: "success", exit: 14 } }
  ]
}
```

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "ace.m2.p985.cover.owned-relay"
  tags: ["ace-m2", "m2-cover-985", "plan-985"]
  links: ["PLAN-985"]
  source: { file: "src/owned-relay.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "av-owned", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: { recipe: "ac-av/resource-events-v1", av: { entry: "d_main", resource: { profile: "owned" } }, steps: [{ op: "run" }] },
      expect: { completion: "success", exit: 405 } }
  ]
}
```
